# DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731 on ds4, antirez's engine written for this one model, in Entrpi's
# fork for the GB10 (MIT), with antirez's 2-bit GGUF and the DSpark draft beside it. The other
# DeepSeek profiles run Unsloth's builds on llama.cpp, which reads prompts at about 320 tok/s
# here; ds4 is reported at about 1,000 on one Spark, and its cache holds the full 1M window in
# about 4 GiB. spark/ds4.sh fetches, builds and serves it; see its header.
TITLE="DeepSeek V4 Flash on ds4"
DETAIL="284B, 13B active, 2-bit GGUF for ds4 and the DSpark draft, 94 GB"
SERVED_NAME=deepseek-v4-flash
MAX_LEN=1048576
MIN_FREE_GB=100
THINKING=native
TOOLS="ds4, DeepSeek's DSML format"
RUNNER=spark/ds4.sh
PULL="spark/ds4.sh fetch"
PREPARE="spark/ds4.sh build"
